    title: "Phase 3, Days 29-35: Pitching, chipping and bunkers",
    text: "DAY 29: Pitch and Chip Shot Development\n• Stretching (15 minutes)\n• Warm-up swings with your own clubs (40 swings) — use any iron, practice in an open area free of obstacles\n• Pitch shots (40 balls): quarter-swing (15), half-swing (15), three-quarter swing (10)\n• Chip shots (35 balls): bump-and-run (20), standard chips (15)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (75 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles\nDAY 30: Short Game Refinement\n• Repeat Day 29 structure\n• Focus on areas identified as weak from previous day\n• Emphasize distance control — land the ball on a specific spot, not just near the hole\nDAY 31: Basic Bunker Mechanics\n• Stretching (15 minutes)\n• Warm-up swings with your own clubs (40 swings) — use any iron, practice in an open area free of obstacles\n• Practice session (75 balls)\n• Basic setup and splash shots (25 balls)\n• Entry point practice — enter 2 inches behind ball (25 balls)\n• Follow-through and finish (25 balls)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (75 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles\nDAY 32: Standard Bunker Shots\n• Practice session (50 balls)\n• Standard greenside bunker shots (25 balls)\n• Varying distances (25 balls)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (100 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles\nDAY 33: Lie Variations\n• Practice session (50 balls)\n• Uphill lies (20 balls)\n• Downhill lies (15 balls)\n• Buried lies (15 balls)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (100 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles\nDAY 34: Bunker Distance Control\n• Practice session (75 balls)\n• Short bunker shots (25 balls)\n• Medium bunker shots (25 balls)\n• Long bunker shots (25 balls)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (75 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles\nDAY 35: Sand Textures\n• Practice session (50 balls)\n• Soft sand technique (25 balls)\n• Hard or packed sand technique (25 balls)\n• Additional practice swings with your own clubs (100 swings) — ensure full range of motion in all directions, open area free of obstacles",
